2
01:37.910 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.100 --> 01:43.720
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.720 --> 01:45.880
[Episode 28]

5
01:46.560 --> 01:47.350
Father.

6
01:48.479 --> 01:49.710
There is something

7
01:50.680 --> 01:51.920
I must report to you.

8
01:52.840 --> 01:53.640
Speak.

9
01:57.640 --> 01:58.509
I have been poisoned by

10
01:58.509 --> 02:00.440
Liluo's deadly Chiying Bug Venom,

11
02:01.280 --> 02:02.760
and my days are numbered.

12
02:04.590 --> 02:05.640
At any moment, I could become

13
02:05.640 --> 02:08.240
Liluo's puppet, controlled by their strings.

14
02:08.710 --> 02:09.570
There is no cure

15
02:10.630 --> 02:11.840
has no cure.

16
02:14.300 --> 02:17.010
[Where Virtue Abides, Grace Abounds]

17
02:19.710 --> 02:20.520
Yan!

18
02:24.430 --> 02:25.630
It's all my fault.

19
02:26.840 --> 02:28.430
It's all my fault.

20
02:32.470 --> 02:33.310
Yan...

21
02:38.630 --> 02:39.470
Guo Anbang!

22
02:39.840 --> 02:40.900
Yes, Your Majesty.

23
02:41.050 --> 02:41.970
Summon Grand Secretary

24
02:41.970 --> 02:43.530
and Xuanyuan Shan at once!

25
02:43.560 --> 02:44.620
Yes, Your Majesty.

26
03:14.470 --> 03:16.000
Greetings, Your Holiness.

27
03:16.590 --> 03:18.079
Everything on this earth

28
03:18.110 --> 03:19.440
will eventually decay.

29
03:20.120 --> 03:23.000
Only the glory of Liluo and Your Holiness

30
03:24.000 --> 03:25.840
shall endure for all eternity.

31
03:37.430 --> 03:39.079
I have confirmed

32
03:39.630 --> 03:41.190
