34
03:44.430 --> 03:45.560
It seems tonight

35
03:45.710 --> 03:48.010
will be his last.

36
03:48.430 --> 03:50.030
Li San spent 17 years

37
03:50.590 --> 03:54.590
plotting this scheme.

38
03:55.400 --> 03:56.810
What a pity

39
03:57.800 --> 03:59.520
he couldn't live to see it.

40
04:00.870 --> 04:02.470
Do you mean, Your Holiness,

41
04:03.400 --> 04:05.330
that once Li Si ascends the throne,

42
04:06.120 --> 04:07.030
we can activate

43
04:07.030 --> 04:09.870
the Ten Thousand Gu Devouring Heart of the Chiying bugs

44
04:09.870 --> 04:12.680
to make him serve our purposes?

45
04:14.590 --> 04:17.260
The real show is about to begin!

46
05:14.480 --> 05:16.160
His Majesty's verbal decree:

47
05:16.390 --> 05:20.640
Bai Qi and Xuanyuan Shan, please enter the palace for an audience!

48
05:27.680 --> 05:29.610
-I, Bai Qi... -I, Xuanyuan Shan...

49
05:42.390 --> 05:45.950
This is the new final edict I've drafted.

50
05:50.190 --> 05:51.510
Take a look.

51
05:57.920 --> 05:59.070
Your Majesty is still with us.

52
05:59.070 --> 06:00.570
How could we presume to read your final edict?

53
06:00.570 --> 06:01.480
We dare not.

54
06:01.510 --> 06:02.800
I said read it.

55
06:04.070 --> 06:05.270
So read it.

56
06:33.830 --> 06:34.630
Your Majesty.

57
06:34.720 --> 06:35.510
Xuanyuan.

58
06:35.630 --> 06:36.690
Yes, Your Majesty.

59
06:39.510 --> 06:40.510
Grand Secretary.

60
06:41.120 --> 06:42.180
Yes, Your Majesty.

61
06:48.070 --> 06:49.600
I'm counting on you.

62
06:50.240 --> 06:52.040
Please take care, Your Majesty.

63
06:52.190 --> 06:54.630
Please take care, Your Majesty.

64
07:00.040 --> 07:04.970
[Taiji Hall]

65
07:07.000 --> 07:08.000
Please forgive me

66
07:08.480 --> 07:10.000
and let me be Crown Prince.

67
07:10.950 --> 07:11.750
Father.

68
07:12.830 --> 07:13.800
I was wrong.

69
07:14.120 --> 07:15.510
Let me be Crown Prince.

70
07:16.390 --> 07:17.350
Father.

71
07:17.800 --> 07:19.270
let me be Crown Prince.

72
07:19.720 --> 07:21.270
Let me be Crown Prince.

73
07:22.190 --> 07:23.040
Father.

74
07:23.450 --> 07:29.190
[Taiji Hall]

75
07:23.870 --> 07:25.040
I was wrong.

76
07:25.430 --> 07:26.950
Let me be Crown Prince.

77
07:27.630 --> 07:28.430
Father.

78
08:20.040 --> 08:22.570
You're afflicted with the Chiying Bug Venom.

79
08:24.800 --> 08:25.860
The people of Liluo

80
08:27.070 --> 08:30.560
will surely use you to sow chaos in our Great Shi.

81
08:36.630 --> 08:39.360
I cannot risk the entire realm just for your sake.

82
08:41.240 --> 08:42.360
This throne—

83
08:45.030 --> 08:47.480
I cannot pass it on to you.

84
09:09.000 --> 09:09.790
Yan?

85
09:11.150 --> 09:11.960
Yan!

86
09:27.900 --> 09:29.760
Father, have you ever considered

87
09:30.600 --> 09:32.660
how the people of Liluo will treat me,

88
09:33.030 --> 09:35.080
a discarded pawn, once they learn

89
09:36.080 --> 09:39.080
I have no chance of inheriting the throne of Great Shi?

90
09:47.790 --> 09:49.120
In your eyes, Father,

91
09:49.870 --> 09:52.000
I've already become a discarded pawn.

92
09:52.320 --> 09:53.780
As for the people of Liluo,

93
09:53.870 --> 09:55.960
though they see me as a pawn too,

94
09:56.880 --> 09:59.000
at least see me as one worth using.

95
10:00.600 --> 10:02.400
The distinction between the two

96
10:04.080 --> 10:05.950
is hard to explain clearly.

97
10:06.030 --> 10:06.910
Yan,

98
10:08.240 --> 10:10.500
you must not think this way.

99
10:11.390 --> 10:13.030
I've thought of you every day

100
10:13.630 --> 10:15.840
for the past 17 years.

101
10:15.910 --> 10:16.790
That's exactly what you said

102
10:16.790 --> 10:18.360
17 years ago, Father.

103
10:19.600 --> 10:20.580
You once swore

104
10:22.200 --> 10:24.460
you'd never let me suffer any injustice.

105
10:25.670 --> 10:26.600
But back then,

106
10:27.670 --> 10:29.730
for the sake of political stability,

107
10:30.840 --> 10:32.170
you broke your promise.

108
10:34.840 --> 10:35.630
And today,

109
10:38.440 --> 10:40.000
you're doing it again.

110
10:54.840 --> 10:55.630
Yan.

111
10:56.120 --> 10:56.910
Yan!

112
10:58.000 --> 10:59.060
What are you doing?

113
11:18.600 --> 11:19.480
With this bow,

114
11:20.670 --> 11:22.330
I thank Your Majesty

115
11:22.790 --> 11:25.920
for the boundless grace of giving me life and raising me.

116
11:27.240 --> 11:28.440
From this day forth,

117
11:29.670 --> 11:31.330
Zhou Yan, bound by royal ties,

118
11:32.080 --> 11:34.750
shall cease to exist in this world.

119
11:35.720 --> 11:38.320
There will be only Li Si, a commoner of jianghu.

120
11:40.440 --> 11:41.510
Yan.

121
11:50.480 --> 11:52.440
It was all my fault.

122
11:54.870 --> 11:57.190
Can you forgive me?

123
11:58.140 --> 11:59.600
Yan!

124
12:12.910 --> 12:14.030
With this bow,

125
12:15.030 --> 12:17.490
I pay my respects to the imperial ancestors.

126
12:18.240 --> 12:19.440
Ancestors above,

127
12:19.360 --> 12:22.390
♪ Capture my heart ♪

128
12:20.840 --> 12:22.640
I, Li Si, shall forever remember

129
12:22.920 --> 12:26.150
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

130
12:23.720 --> 12:25.180
the vast realm of Great Shi

131
12:26.510 --> 12:28.510
entrusted to us.

132
12:27.170 --> 12:32.570
♪ Can we relive the mark you once carved deep? ♪

133
12:33.130 --> 12:36.160
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

134
12:34.670 --> 12:35.480
Yan.

135
12:36.200 --> 12:38.030
I've been watering that little tree

136
12:37.010 --> 12:40.170
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

137
12:38.670 --> 12:41.120
outside the study every day.

138
12:41.240 --> 12:47.180
♪ In a moment, I fell, a lifetime left to heal ♪

139
12:41.790 --> 12:43.200
Did you know that?

140
12:44.080 --> 12:45.840
Did you know that?

141
12:47.550 --> 12:50.610
♪ Tossing and turning through endless nights ♪

142
12:49.630 --> 12:50.960
Yan...

143
12:51.430 --> 12:54.530
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

144
12:51.440 --> 12:53.480
I was wrong.

145
12:54.270 --> 12:56.270
Please forgive me.

146
12:55.200 --> 13:00.910
♪ Will we meet again, those I dare not face? ♪

147
12:58.720 --> 13:00.600
Forgive me...

148
13:01.520 --> 13:04.600
♪ One thought to ferry me across the sea of suffering ♪

149
13:05.270 --> 13:08.270
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

150
13:09.630 --> 13:15.610
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough, till all turn to dust ♪

151
13:15.800 --> 13:18.870
♪ Dare not forget ♪

152
13:19.620 --> 13:22.900
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

153
13:21.790 --> 13:23.720
With this third bow, I pay my respects to the people of Great Shi.

154
13:23.720 --> 13:29.860
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

155
13:24.440 --> 13:26.570
The common folk toil to feed the realm,

156
13:26.870 --> 13:28.670
sustaining the imperial household

157
13:28.670 --> 13:29.910
and the royal clan,

158
13:30.600 --> 13:33.750
♪ Dare not think ♪

159
13:31.270 --> 13:33.400
yet we have done nothing to repay them.

160
13:34.040 --> 13:37.100
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

161
13:34.840 --> 13:35.670
It's just that

162
13:37.200 --> 13:39.240
from this day forth, I, Li Si, am no longer of the imperial family.

163
13:38.010 --> 13:44.380
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

164
13:39.960 --> 13:40.750
Thus,

165
13:43.000 --> 13:46.260
I need no longer concern myself with the people's welfare.

166
13:46.790 --> 13:50.750
♪ Hidden in your shadow, I'll follow you forever ♪

167
13:53.610 --> 13:57.640
♪ Hidden in your shadow, I'll follow you forever ♪

168
14:01.810 --> 14:04.640
♪ Who lies in the abyss? ♪

169
14:05.160 --> 14:08.300
♪ This chapter of the past ♪

170
14:08.900 --> 14:14.160
♪ Who is the ferryman, ferrying others and himself for half a lifetime? ♪

171
14:09.240 --> 14:11.100
Having no other way to repay them,

172
14:12.000 --> 14:14.550
I can only offer my very life in return.

173
14:15.350 --> 14:18.800
♪ Where lies the other shore? ♪

174
14:19.530 --> 14:22.520
♪ A silent reflection ♪

175
14:23.020 --> 14:29.330
♪ I see through truth and lies, yet cannot see through love and hate ♪

176
14:30.000 --> 14:33.240
♪ Dare not forget ♪

177
14:33.690 --> 14:36.890
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

178
14:37.420 --> 14:43.420
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

179
14:44.280 --> 14:47.430
♪ Dare not think ♪

180
14:47.730 --> 14:50.780
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

181
14:51.700 --> 14:58.060
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

182
14:58.370 --> 15:01.610
♪ Dare not speak too soon ♪

183
15:02.060 --> 15:05.340
♪ Torn apart inside ♪

184
15:05.790 --> 15:11.780
♪ Only in love can we escape withering away ♪

185
15:12.540 --> 15:16.500
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

186
15:12.710 --> 15:15.660
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

187
15:16.130 --> 15:19.160
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

188
15:18.390 --> 15:19.600
Yan!

189
15:20.080 --> 15:26.710
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

190
15:28.290 --> 15:32.130
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

191
15:35.120 --> 15:39.640
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

192
15:38.830 --> 15:43.720
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

193
15:49.240 --> 15:52.210
[Taiji Hall]

194
15:58.580 --> 16:03.570
[Taiji Hall]

195
16:10.070 --> 16:15.780
[Yu'an Hall]

196
16:18.080 --> 16:20.510
His Majesty...

197
16:22.510 --> 16:26.270
Has passed away!

198
16:24.420 --> 16:28.660
[Taiji Hall]

199
16:34.420 --> 16:38.590
[Taiji Hall]

200
16:48.660 --> 16:52.320
[Chief Constable's Hall]

201
16:57.120 --> 16:58.270
Exactly 9 tolls.

202
16:59.870 --> 17:01.930
That was the national mourning bell.

203
17:02.720 --> 17:03.630
His Majesty

204
17:05.480 --> 17:06.480
has passed away.

205
17:23.109 --> 17:29.840
[Taiji Hall]

206
18:00.030 --> 18:03.270
His Majesty has passed away.

207
18:03.720 --> 18:06.790
Prince Xian, why are you here at the Fengbo Hall

208
18:06.920 --> 18:09.920
instead of keeping vigil at the imperial residence?

209
18:15.640 --> 18:17.970
Grand Secretary, I just saw your carriage

210
18:18.400 --> 18:20.160
leaving the imperial palace.

211
18:20.720 --> 18:21.590
How is it that

212
18:21.620 --> 18:23.030
you have appeared here?

213
18:26.240 --> 18:28.070
If I'm not mistaken,

214
18:29.440 --> 18:31.270
you'll be hiding out

215
18:32.070 --> 18:33.790
in this Fengbo Hall

216
18:33.820 --> 18:36.150
until the new Emperor ascends the throne.

217
18:37.680 --> 18:39.960
After all, only you know

218
18:40.920 --> 18:43.450
where the late Emperor's final edict is kept.

219
18:47.030 --> 18:49.440
Since it determines who will inherit the throne,

220
18:49.440 --> 18:51.000
it must be kept safe.

221
18:53.030 --> 18:54.270
And what place

222
18:54.830 --> 18:56.200
in this entire realm

223
18:56.880 --> 18:58.390
could be safer than

224
18:58.420 --> 18:59.740
the imperial palace?

225
19:01.720 --> 19:03.790
If even Your Highness can come here,

226
19:03.830 --> 19:05.030
then this Fengbo Hall

227
19:06.030 --> 19:07.550
is hardly safe.

228
19:12.880 --> 19:15.000
What do you mean by that, Grand Secretary?

229
19:15.000 --> 19:16.510
I was the only prince

230
19:16.830 --> 19:18.290
summoned by the late Emperor

231
19:18.290 --> 19:19.460
before his death.

232
19:20.070 --> 19:21.870
Who else could be the new Emperor

233
19:22.070 --> 19:23.480
but me?

234
19:25.240 --> 19:26.920
Wherever I am,

235
19:27.480 --> 19:30.480
I have the protection of Heaven and Earth, of spirits and gods.

236
19:30.480 --> 19:31.720
Surely, that makes it the safest place

237
19:31.720 --> 19:33.270
under the heavens.

238
19:41.480 --> 19:42.510
Could it be

239
19:43.590 --> 19:45.350
that I've guessed wrong—

240
19:45.880 --> 19:47.810
that the choice for the new Emperor

241
19:48.510 --> 19:49.920
is not me?

242
19:57.640 --> 20:00.400
Your Highness was also present

243
20:00.640 --> 20:02.790
when the late Emperor wrote his final edict.

244
20:02.790 --> 20:05.520
Why ask a question you already know the answer to?

245
20:15.830 --> 20:17.510
Let me take a guess.

246
20:30.880 --> 20:33.410
Xuanyuan Shan must have told the late Emperor

247
20:33.480 --> 20:35.920
that I'm afflicted with the Chiying Bug Venom

248
20:35.920 --> 20:37.650
and wouldn't live much longer,

249
20:38.200 --> 20:39.480
so I could not possibly

250
20:40.000 --> 20:41.920
inherit the throne,

251
20:42.440 --> 20:43.240
right?

252
20:47.590 --> 20:49.240
Let me guess again.

253
20:53.310 --> 20:54.550
If the new Emperor

254
20:55.590 --> 20:57.440
is not me,

255
20:57.830 --> 20:59.440
then who else could it be?

256
21:02.370 --> 21:04.550
[Zhou Zhu, the Third Prince]

257
21:05.920 --> 21:07.920
Pass the throne to the Third Prince?

258
21:10.920 --> 21:14.320
My eldest and second brothers are already out of the running,

259
21:14.720 --> 21:17.750
and Zhou Yan is also on the brink of death

260
21:17.830 --> 21:19.690
because of the Chiying Bug Venom.

261
21:23.510 --> 21:25.000
For the sake of the realm,

262
21:25.440 --> 21:27.640
even if the late Emperor was unwilling,

263
21:28.240 --> 21:30.240
he had only one choice left:

264
21:35.440 --> 21:39.830
the Third Prince, Prince Ping, Zhou Zhu.

265
21:46.480 --> 21:47.750
May I ask

266
21:48.240 --> 21:51.110
which member of Liluo you are, exactly?

267
21:57.920 --> 21:58.720
It's here.

268
22:06.440 --> 22:08.100
No wonder it looked familiar.

269
22:08.510 --> 22:09.270
I'd seen this flower before

270
22:09.270 --> 22:10.510
when I visited

271
22:10.590 --> 22:11.790
the Crown Prince's residence.

272
22:11.790 --> 22:12.590
I think

273
22:12.880 --> 22:15.000
I've seen this flower somewhere before.

274
22:15.000 --> 22:16.030
This is called Gelsemium vine,

275
22:16.030 --> 22:17.030
a rare find.

276
22:17.240 --> 22:18.270
It's an exotic kind of flower that

277
22:18.270 --> 22:20.240
naturally grows deep in the mountains,

278
22:20.240 --> 22:22.260
bearing a striking resemblance to the trumpet vine.

279
22:22.260 --> 22:23.590
It blooms once every 10 years,

280
22:23.590 --> 22:25.650
and once it blooms, it never withers.

281
22:26.030 --> 22:27.750
If the sap from its petals

282
22:27.830 --> 22:29.400
enters the human body,

283
22:29.510 --> 22:31.240
it'll cause imperceptible physical weakness,

284
22:31.240 --> 22:33.370
leading to gradual decline and death.

285
22:36.510 --> 22:37.440
It's poisonous.

286
22:38.680 --> 22:40.480
It really is the Gelsemium vine.

287
22:41.400 --> 22:43.200
So the Grand Heir Apparent's chronic illness

288
22:43.200 --> 22:44.240
was caused by someone

289
22:44.240 --> 22:45.240
poisoning his food

290
22:45.240 --> 22:46.750
with this Gelsemium vine.

291
22:47.240 --> 22:48.440
After years of exposure,

292
22:48.440 --> 22:50.310
his body finally gave out.

293
22:50.310 --> 22:51.880
I never expected to find Gelsemium vine

294
22:51.880 --> 22:53.740
in the Crown Prince's residence.

295
22:54.030 --> 22:56.510
It seems the culprit behind Grand Heir Apparent's death...

296
22:56.510 --> 22:59.310
Was someone within the Crown Prince's residence.

297
23:05.960 --> 23:07.760
A little late to be guessing now,

298
23:07.960 --> 23:09.310
don't you think?

299
23:11.440 --> 23:12.440
Grand Secretary,

300
23:13.440 --> 23:14.500
pardon my offense.

301
23:26.070 --> 23:27.730
The Heaven-Measuring Ruler?

302
24:07.350 --> 24:08.310
Eunuch Zhao?

303
24:09.510 --> 24:10.310
It's you.

304
24:17.350 --> 24:18.390
Li Si.

305
24:18.680 --> 24:20.790
You ruined my face.

306
24:23.030 --> 24:25.240
I was furious,

307
24:26.680 --> 24:28.160
but you were the future Emperor,

308
24:28.160 --> 24:30.240
so I had no choice but to swallow my anger.

309
24:30.240 --> 24:32.000
What a predicament.

310
24:32.400 --> 24:33.590
So that's how it is.

311
24:35.350 --> 24:36.830
No ordinary person could break into

312
24:36.830 --> 24:38.560
the Crown Prince's residence.

313
24:38.590 --> 24:40.000
And with a eunuch like you

314
24:40.440 --> 24:41.880
tasting Grand Heir Apparent's

315
24:41.880 --> 24:43.110
food first,

316
24:43.400 --> 24:45.590
how could he possibly have been poisoned?

317
24:45.590 --> 24:46.440
Unless

318
24:47.480 --> 24:49.340
you were the one who poisoned him.

319
24:50.440 --> 24:51.240
And

320
24:53.000 --> 24:54.070
what if I was?

321
24:55.270 --> 24:56.670
Now that I think about it,

322
24:56.880 --> 24:58.400
you were also the one who helped Lou Tianming

323
24:58.400 --> 25:00.640
escape from the Divine Constable Bureau,

324
25:00.640 --> 25:01.880
weren't you?

325
25:02.830 --> 25:04.640
We did suspect

326
25:05.000 --> 25:06.790
there was a mole within the Bureau,

327
25:06.790 --> 25:08.400
but we never imagined

328
25:08.830 --> 25:10.160
it would be you.

329
25:13.030 --> 25:15.690
You always disguised yourself as incompetent,

330
25:16.400 --> 25:17.730
and Lou Tianming nearly

331
25:17.730 --> 25:19.110
bit one of your ears off.

332
25:19.750 --> 25:20.590
We truly

333
25:21.240 --> 25:22.440
would never

334
25:22.640 --> 25:24.790
have suspected you.

335
25:27.070 --> 25:29.030
So you're the Holy Lord of Liluo?

336
25:29.440 --> 25:30.880
Why ask so many questions

337
25:32.960 --> 25:34.720
when death is upon you?

338
25:34.750 --> 25:35.500
Eunuch Zhao,

339
25:35.530 --> 25:37.230
you seem awfully confident

340
25:37.440 --> 25:38.920
in your martial arts.

341
25:40.590 --> 25:43.190
If you still had your Heaven-Measuring Ruler,

342
25:43.440 --> 25:45.550
I'd be somewhat wary of you.

343
25:46.750 --> 25:47.930
But now,

344
25:48.350 --> 25:49.400
apart from

345
25:49.400 --> 25:50.550
Xuanyuan Shan,

346
25:50.550 --> 25:51.400
there's no one

347
25:51.400 --> 25:54.660
in the entire Divine Constable Bureau I consider a threat.

348
25:55.440 --> 25:57.970
There're imperial guards all over the place.

349
25:58.030 --> 25:59.880
All I have to do is shout,

350
26:00.240 --> 26:01.240
and we'll see

351
26:01.550 --> 26:03.280
how many of them you can take on.

352
26:06.200 --> 26:08.830
Even if the place were surrounded by a million soldiers,

353
26:08.830 --> 26:11.440
they could take my life,

354
26:12.680 --> 26:14.830
but they still couldn't save Bai Qi's.

355
26:21.750 --> 26:22.590
You misidentified Grand Secretary

356
26:22.590 --> 26:23.750
in the black chest case.

357
26:23.750 --> 26:26.350
And today, you've made the same mistake again.

358
26:27.640 --> 26:28.510
Who are you?

359
26:43.750 --> 26:45.030
How could it be you?

360
26:48.790 --> 26:49.880
Where's Bai Qi?

361
26:50.200 --> 26:51.460
In the safest place

362
26:51.490 --> 26:52.950
under heavens, of course.

363
26:53.830 --> 26:54.830
Zhao Shanlei.

364
26:55.200 --> 26:57.110
You have no way out today.

365
26:58.070 --> 26:59.480
Just surrender.

366
26:59.680 --> 27:00.510
Li Si.

367
27:01.400 --> 27:03.000
Have you forgotten that

368
27:03.590 --> 27:06.450
you're still afflicted with the Chiying Bug Venom?

369
27:14.160 --> 27:15.310
You know what will happen

370
27:15.310 --> 27:16.350
once I shake this.

371
27:18.350 --> 27:20.210
Ten Thousand Gu Devouring Heart—

372
27:20.270 --> 27:22.200
making your life worse than death.

373
27:25.400 --> 27:26.350
Xuanyuan Shan.

374
27:27.960 --> 27:29.270
Even if you have immense power,

375
27:29.270 --> 27:31.730
you still can't cure this Chiying Bug Venom.

376
27:31.830 --> 27:33.310
There are only 5 steps

377
27:34.750 --> 27:36.110
between you and me.

378
27:37.590 --> 27:39.990
Have you ever heard of a kill within 5 steps?

379
27:40.960 --> 27:43.160
I may not be able to cure the Chiying Bug Venom,

380
27:43.160 --> 27:44.730
but I'm certain

381
27:45.030 --> 27:46.440
that I can take your life

382
27:46.590 --> 27:48.110
within 5 steps.

383
28:25.480 --> 28:26.480
Yan...

384
28:32.880 --> 28:33.750
Yan...

385
28:36.880 --> 28:38.050
Why?

386
28:40.000 --> 28:41.240
Seventeen years ago,

387
28:42.590 --> 28:45.650
Father knew my eldest and second brothers had set me up,

388
28:46.790 --> 28:48.640
yet he still buried the truth.

389
28:50.160 --> 28:51.490
Seventeen years later,

390
28:52.240 --> 28:54.440
just when we had finally been reunited,

391
28:55.640 --> 28:56.640
he learned that

392
28:56.640 --> 28:59.040
I was afflicted with the Chiying Bug Venom,

393
29:00.200 --> 29:01.400
and handed the throne to Third Brother

394
29:01.400 --> 29:03.400
without a moment's hesitation.

395
29:06.160 --> 29:07.790
Though I'd seen it coming,

396
29:09.590 --> 29:11.270
it still broke my heart.

397
29:16.200 --> 29:18.110
Did Father never consider

398
29:18.440 --> 29:20.570
how the people of Liluo would treat me,

399
29:21.160 --> 29:22.160
a discarded pawn,

400
29:23.000 --> 29:25.200
if I could no longer inherit the throne?

401
29:29.790 --> 29:30.890
Li Qingyang.

402
29:32.030 --> 29:33.690
I know how cunning you are.

403
29:34.160 --> 29:36.680
Don't try to play tricks on me.

404
29:48.640 --> 29:49.590
Yan.

405
29:52.070 --> 29:53.680
It's not too late for you

406
29:55.030 --> 29:56.480
to turn back.

407
29:57.640 --> 29:58.510
Turn back?

408
30:02.200 --> 30:03.860
If turning back was an option,

409
30:04.680 --> 30:06.210
why didn't Father turn back

410
30:06.880 --> 30:08.680
17 years ago?

411
30:12.240 --> 30:13.920
Why didn't any of you?

412
30:39.830 --> 30:41.000
Chief Xuanyuan.

413
30:42.070 --> 30:43.280
You just said

414
30:43.590 --> 30:45.170
Grand Secretary Bai had already been

415
30:45.170 --> 30:47.430
taken into the Divine Constable Bureau.

416
30:47.480 --> 30:49.540
But there's one thing you don't know.

417
30:50.010 --> 30:51.550
Liluo still has

418
30:52.400 --> 30:53.960
a hidden piece in play

419
30:53.960 --> 30:56.020
within the Divine Constable Bureau.

420
31:05.310 --> 31:06.310
Grand Secretary.

421
31:06.590 --> 31:08.160
Worrying now is useless.

422
31:08.680 --> 31:09.960
You'd better sit down and rest.

423
31:09.960 --> 31:10.640
That's right, Grand Secretary.

424
31:10.640 --> 31:11.880
I brought you some warm water.

425
31:11.880 --> 31:12.590
Please wash your face,

426
31:12.590 --> 31:13.920
and you'll feel better.

427
31:14.310 --> 31:15.110
Careful...

428
31:15.510 --> 31:16.450
Be careful.

429
31:16.570 --> 31:17.820
M-Mr. Yan.

430
31:19.220 --> 31:20.030
Let me do it.

431
31:21.880 --> 31:22.640
Grand Secretary.

432
31:22.640 --> 31:23.270
Here.

433
31:23.270 --> 31:24.200
Wash your hands.

434
31:30.470 --> 31:31.490
Grand Secretary!

435
31:47.070 --> 31:48.100
Grand Secretary!

436
31:48.790 --> 31:49.790
Grand Secretary!

437
31:53.680 --> 31:54.510
Why?

438
31:55.240 --> 31:56.710
Why did you do that?

439
31:59.400 --> 32:00.200
Mr. Yan.

440
32:00.350 --> 32:02.430
You don't understand.

441
32:03.030 --> 32:05.130
Holy Queen hasn't forgotten me.

442
32:05.800 --> 32:07.160
Three years in the shadows,

443
32:07.160 --> 32:08.790
all for this one moment of triumph.

444
32:08.790 --> 32:09.920
It was worth it.

445
32:11.070 --> 32:12.240
It was worth it.

446
32:13.640 --> 32:15.180
You're from Liluo?

447
32:16.070 --> 32:17.270
How is that possible?

448
32:18.960 --> 32:19.750
Tell me,

449
32:19.960 --> 32:21.440
who else is with you?

450
32:21.680 --> 32:22.550
Who else!

451
32:23.030 --> 32:24.130
Say it!

452
32:37.400 --> 32:38.620
Our people

453
32:40.880 --> 32:42.000
are everywhere.

454
32:42.590 --> 32:43.720
Everywhere...

455
32:45.300 --> 32:46.620
Everywhere...

456
33:11.400 --> 33:13.350
Who else?

457
33:15.240 --> 33:17.680
Who else!

458
33:19.000 --> 33:21.310
Bai Qi is already dead.

459
33:23.000 --> 33:25.110
You want to forge the posthumous edict

460
33:25.110 --> 33:25.860
and make Yan

461
33:25.880 --> 33:27.000
your puppet emperor?

462
33:27.000 --> 33:28.440
You're wrong again.

463
33:28.480 --> 33:29.680
We don't need to

464
33:29.720 --> 33:30.980
forge the edict at all.

465
33:31.400 --> 33:33.110
I just need to kill you

466
33:33.480 --> 33:34.750
and Bai Qi.

467
33:34.880 --> 33:36.480
With the edict left hanging,

468
33:36.590 --> 33:37.640
the only one

469
33:38.000 --> 33:39.550
to inherit the throne

470
33:40.160 --> 33:42.160
will be the Fourth Prince.

471
33:53.480 --> 33:54.750
Zhao Shanlei.

472
33:55.590 --> 33:58.000
I'll kill you today

473
33:58.640 --> 34:00.820
to uphold the honor of Great Shi!

474
34:46.580 --> 34:47.710
Fourth Prince.

475
34:49.030 --> 34:50.960
You're indeed ruthless.

476
34:52.000 --> 34:53.260
That's cold-blooded.

477
34:56.760 --> 35:00.400
See to it that Xuanyuan Shan's body is properly disposed of.

478
35:03.360 --> 35:05.410
Once I ascend the throne,

479
35:06.190 --> 35:07.710
I'll use her corpse

480
35:08.940 --> 35:10.400
to avenge this grudge.

481
35:14.710 --> 35:15.760
As expected.

482
35:20.000 --> 35:20.880
As expected, you're a fine disciple

483
35:20.880 --> 35:23.190
trained by Li San.

484
35:29.760 --> 35:30.670
Come with me.

485
35:31.590 --> 35:33.030
Someone wants to see you.

486
36:00.590 --> 36:02.120
Greetings, Your Holiness.

487
36:02.590 --> 36:03.880
Envoy Zhao said

488
36:04.150 --> 36:07.320
Li Si killed Xuanyuan Shan with his own hands

489
36:07.360 --> 36:10.060
to show his loyalty to Liluo.

490
36:10.400 --> 36:11.420
Exactly.

491
36:11.760 --> 36:13.440
I saw it with my own eyes

492
36:13.440 --> 36:15.300
and have verified it thoroughly.

493
36:15.360 --> 36:16.360
Xuanyuan Shan

494
36:17.070 --> 36:18.320
is dead.

495
36:19.080 --> 36:21.900
With Bai Qi and Xuanyuan Shan dead,

496
36:22.190 --> 36:24.250
our great plan is half accomplished.

497
36:25.000 --> 36:26.800
Bring Li Si in.

498
36:27.010 --> 36:28.220
You may leave now.

499
36:28.430 --> 36:29.220
-Yes. -Yes.

500
36:38.470 --> 36:40.220
The Holy Queen summons you.

501
37:04.960 --> 37:05.890
Second Brother?

502
37:05.920 --> 37:06.720
My beloved...

503
37:22.480 --> 37:23.280
It's you,

504
37:24.280 --> 37:25.500
Crown Princess.

505
37:26.110 --> 37:27.640
Your Highness Prince Xian.

506
37:28.400 --> 37:30.280
Why is it that you haven't paid your respects

507
37:30.280 --> 37:31.810
to me, your sister-in-law?

508
38:05.800 --> 38:06.840
Tianmoluo.

509
38:07.670 --> 38:09.130
The fruit of immortality.

510
38:09.710 --> 38:10.510
So

511
38:11.320 --> 38:13.120
the fruit of immortality may not

512
38:13.120 --> 38:14.580
truly grant immortality,

513
38:15.400 --> 38:16.790
but it can preserve

514
38:17.230 --> 38:18.760
one's youthful appearance

515
38:19.190 --> 38:20.920
and reverse the signs of aging.

516
38:41.480 --> 38:42.280
Chief.

517
38:42.590 --> 38:44.550
This wound pierced straight through your heart.

518
38:44.550 --> 38:47.150
How did you manage to hide it from Zhao Shanlei?

519
38:48.000 --> 38:51.560
Prince Xian avoided my vitals,

520
38:53.110 --> 38:55.220
and I held my breath to feign death.

521
38:59.840 --> 39:01.340
Did His Highness Prince Xian

522
39:01.340 --> 39:02.800
send you here to assist me?

523
39:02.800 --> 39:03.480
Yes.

524
39:07.000 --> 39:09.800
The enemy was in the dark while we were in the clear.

525
39:10.440 --> 39:12.730
Prince Xian and I devised a plan

526
39:13.710 --> 39:15.800
for him to feign an attempt on my life,

527
39:16.630 --> 39:18.400
all to gain the trust

528
39:18.800 --> 39:20.920
of Liluo's Dark Night.

529
39:21.280 --> 39:22.280
In that case,

530
39:22.710 --> 39:23.550
His Highness Prince Xian

531
39:23.550 --> 39:24.480
should have met

532
39:24.480 --> 39:26.140
the Holy Queen of Liluo by now.

533
39:28.190 --> 39:30.070
Now that you've seen me,

534
39:30.280 --> 39:31.280
and there're only

535
39:31.440 --> 39:33.190
the two of us...

536
39:35.110 --> 39:36.360
and that dog here,

537
39:37.110 --> 39:39.230
now is your best chance.

538
39:40.000 --> 39:42.760
Why haven't you made your move?

539
39:42.920 --> 39:44.850
I've already killed Xuanyuan Shan

540
39:45.000 --> 39:46.260
to show my allegiance.

541
39:46.440 --> 39:48.590
Do you still not trust me, Holy Queen?

542
39:49.630 --> 39:51.710
I can't care less whether Xuanyuan Shan

543
39:51.710 --> 39:54.030
is truly dead or not,

544
39:54.310 --> 39:55.220
nor do I care

545
39:55.800 --> 39:58.110
if your intentions are genuine.

546
39:58.480 --> 39:59.610
I simply dare not bet

547
39:59.620 --> 40:02.080
on the unpredictability of the human heart.

548
40:03.400 --> 40:04.960
What concerns me is that

549
40:06.630 --> 40:08.830
once the Liluo people see through this,

550
40:09.630 --> 40:12.090
His Highness's life will be in grave danger.

551
40:12.630 --> 40:13.630
Or,

552
40:14.840 --> 40:15.920
if the Holy Queen

553
40:16.800 --> 40:20.030
insists on activating the Ten Thousand Gu Devouring Heart,

554
40:20.030 --> 40:21.630
His Highness Prince Xian

555
40:23.230 --> 40:25.320
will likely meet a tragic end.

556
40:30.840 --> 40:33.320
This plan is far too perilous.

557
40:35.630 --> 40:37.090
At this point, all we can do

558
40:37.280 --> 40:39.280
is leave it to fate.

559
40:40.920 --> 40:43.110
The human heart is indeed difficult to fathom.

560
40:43.110 --> 40:45.710
For the sake of restoring Liluo's great cause,

561
40:45.840 --> 40:47.800
Holy Queen, you were even willing to sacrifice

562
40:47.800 --> 40:48.670
your own son,

563
40:49.280 --> 40:50.880
Zhou Ye.

564
40:51.320 --> 40:52.720
With such ruthlessness,

565
40:52.880 --> 40:54.400
even my father

566
40:54.920 --> 40:56.580
would have to concede defeat.

567
40:57.280 --> 40:58.110
No wonder

568
40:58.800 --> 40:59.840
the Great Shi

569
41:00.710 --> 41:02.770
will ultimately perish by your hand.

570
41:09.880 --> 41:10.630
Do you really think

571
41:10.630 --> 41:13.480
I would bear a child for this stupid dog?

572
41:14.400 --> 41:15.230
Zhou Ye

573
41:15.400 --> 41:16.880
is nothing but a bastard

574
41:17.030 --> 41:18.190
I had someone find

575
41:18.190 --> 41:20.440
off the streets.

576
41:21.800 --> 41:22.760
A bastard,

577
41:23.000 --> 41:23.880
understand?

578
41:25.230 --> 41:26.660
You people of Great Shi

579
41:26.840 --> 41:28.550
only deserve bastards

580
41:28.660 --> 41:30.510
as your descendants.

581
41:40.070 --> 41:42.550
I'm not a dog.

582
41:43.280 --> 41:46.110
I'm the dignified Crown Prince of Great Shi,

583
41:46.110 --> 41:47.710
Zhou Tiao!

584
41:56.590 --> 41:57.520
Fourth Brother,

585
41:58.720 --> 41:59.950
we must never...

586
42:00.070 --> 42:02.790
We must never let the Great Shi's empire

587
42:03.030 --> 42:06.180
fall into the hands of these Liluo bandits!

588
42:52.230 --> 42:53.160
Second Brother.

589
42:53.630 --> 42:56.070
The Holy Queen has absolutely no interest

590
42:57.640 --> 42:59.970
in that throne you've coveted for so long.

591
43:00.230 --> 43:01.800
The one who will claim it

592
43:03.920 --> 43:04.730
is me.

593
43:08.110 --> 43:09.040
Second Brother,

594
43:15.800 --> 43:17.440
just rest in peace.

595
43:37.630 --> 43:38.400
Now that

596
43:39.670 --> 43:41.070
the Crown Prince is also dead,

597
43:41.070 --> 43:42.690
do you still doubt

598
43:42.720 --> 43:44.180
my sincerity, Holy Queen?

599
43:50.000 --> 43:51.290
Then what if

600
43:53.030 --> 43:55.070
I were to destroy the Four-Dimensional Eight-Direction

601
43:55.070 --> 43:56.590
Guili Formation?

602
43:57.920 --> 43:59.220
You know

603
43:59.400 --> 44:01.400
where the Four-Dimensional Eight-Direction Guili Formation

604
44:01.400 --> 44:02.360
is?

605
44:06.030 --> 44:07.430
Please look, Holy Queen,

606
44:09.110 --> 44:10.640
In the 10th year of Zhengwu,

607
44:11.000 --> 44:12.630
7 years had passed since the extermination

608
44:12.630 --> 44:21.600
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

609
44:12.710 --> 44:14.630
of the Kingdom of Liluo.

610
44:15.630 --> 44:16.880
The late emperor still shuddered

611
44:16.880 --> 44:19.150
at the memory of the Liluo people's

612
44:19.710 --> 44:22.440
various miraculous and extraordinary sorcery.

613
44:22.710 --> 44:24.920
It was in the spring of that very year

614
44:25.670 --> 44:27.920
that the late Emperor secretly summoned

615
44:27.920 --> 44:30.480
a powerful sorcerer of profound spiritual attainment.

616
44:30.480 --> 44:32.190
In a secret underground palace,

617
44:32.190 --> 44:32.800
they set up

618
44:32.800 --> 44:35.630
the Four-Dimensional Eight-Direction Guili Formation,

619
44:35.630 --> 44:37.030
sealing the vortex of the earth veins

620
44:37.030 --> 44:38.430
beneath Tianhuang City,

621
44:38.630 --> 44:39.800
which is the legendary

622
44:39.800 --> 44:41.110
Star Gate.

623
44:42.110 --> 44:43.230
I see.

624
44:44.840 --> 44:47.510
Once the Star Gate was sealed, the earth veins were obstructed

625
44:47.510 --> 44:49.000
and spiritual energy dissipated.

626
44:49.000 --> 44:50.630
As a result, with no spiritual energy

627
44:50.630 --> 44:52.110
left in the city,

628
44:52.510 --> 44:54.440
all manner of spells and arts in this world

629
44:54.440 --> 44:56.440
would naturally cease to be effective.

630
44:56.440 --> 44:57.970
It was precisely because of

631
44:58.800 --> 45:01.150
the influence of this formation

632
45:02.110 --> 45:03.510
that the Liluo demon-men were unable to

633
45:03.510 --> 45:06.190
enter Tianhuang City in large numbers and wreak havoc.

634
45:06.190 --> 45:08.670
So this is the origin of the Absolute Prohibition.

635
45:08.670 --> 45:09.670
Its key

636
45:10.710 --> 45:12.310
lies in the Guili Formation.

637
45:35.510 --> 45:36.960
Do you believe me now?

638
45:38.480 --> 45:39.480
Then I ask

639
45:40.670 --> 45:42.400
that Your Majesty-to-be

640
45:42.800 --> 45:45.510
visit the underground palace in person.

641
45:47.550 --> 45:48.360
Yes.

642
45:59.320 --> 46:00.800
Stay close to Li Si.

643
46:01.030 --> 46:01.960
Once you see

644
46:01.960 --> 46:04.800
the Four-Dimensional Eight-Direction Guili Formation,

645
46:04.800 --> 46:06.760
destroy its core

646
46:08.070 --> 46:09.840
at all costs.

647
46:10.630 --> 46:12.590
Make sure the earth veins are reconnected

648
46:12.590 --> 46:14.590
so our demon army can enter the city.

649
46:14.920 --> 46:16.960
If he makes any suspicious moves,

650
46:18.320 --> 46:21.710
use the Ten Thousand Gu Devouring Heart to control him.

651
46:22.110 --> 46:22.840
Yes, Your Holiness.

652
46:22.840 --> 46:23.510
Yes, Your Holiness.
